{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"01210b427f64189c","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant Client\n    participant FastAPI as FastAPI App\n    participant UO as Unified Orchestrator\n    participant CL as Config Loader\n    participant BP as Bronze Processor\n    participant SP as Silver Processor\n    participant GP as Gold Processor\n    participant MIS as Metadata Ingestion Service\n    participant LIS as LLM Inference Service\n    participant RDS as Relationship Detection Service\n    participant ES as Embedding Service\n    participant VS as Validation Service\n    participant MongoDB as MongoDB Database\n    participant LLM as Azure OpenAI\n\n    Note over Client, LLM: Unified Framework - Bronze Stage\n\n    Client->>+FastAPI: POST /processSchema {\"schema_type\": \"bronze\"}\n    FastAPI->>+UO: orchestrate(\"bronze\", config)\n    UO->>+CL: load_config(\"bronze\")\n    CL->>CL: Load bronze_config.py, bronze_prompts.txt, field_mappings.py\n    CL-->>-UO: Return bronze configuration\n    \n    UO->>+BP: initialize(bronze_config)\n    BP-->>-UO: Processor ready\n    \n    UO->>+BP: process_metadata()\n    BP->>+MIS: ingest_metadata(source_collections)\n    MIS->>+MongoDB: Read source, table, column collections\n    MongoDB-->>-MIS: Return raw metadata\n    MIS-->>-BP: Standardized metadata\n    \n    BP->>+LIS: generate_inferences(metadata, bronze_prompts)\n    LIS->>+LLM: Process with bronze-specific prompts\n    LLM-->>-LIS: Return enriched metadata\n    LIS->>+ES: generate_embeddings(metadata)\n    ES-->>-LIS: Return embeddings\n    LIS-->>-BP: Enhanced metadata with embeddings\n    \n    BP->>+MongoDB: Update inferred collections\n    MongoDB-->>-BP: Confirm updates\n    BP-->>-UO: Metadata processing complete\n    \n    UO->>+BP: generate_relationships()\n    BP->>+RDS: detect_relationships(inferred_metadata)\n    RDS->>+MongoDB: Load embedded data\n    MongoDB-->>-RDS: Return data with embeddings\n    RDS->>RDS: Calculate semantic similarity\n    RDS->>+LIS: infer_relationships(relationship_prompts)\n    LIS->>+LLM: Process relationship inference\n    LLM-->>-LIS: Return relationship data\n    LIS-->>-RDS: Processed relationships\n    RDS-->>-BP: Relationship mappings\n    \n    BP->>+MongoDB: Update relationship data\n    MongoDB-->>-BP: Confirm updates\n    BP-->>-UO: Relationships complete\n    \n    UO->>+BP: create_schema()\n    BP->>BP: Generate Cytoscape edges (table-table, source-table, table-column)\n    BP->>+MongoDB: Insert edge metadata\n    MongoDB-->>-BP: Confirm edge creation\n    BP-->>-UO: Schema creation complete\n    \n    UO->>+BP: validate_output()\n    BP->>+VS: validate_schema(cytoscape_format)\n    VS-->>-BP: Validation results\n    BP-->>-UO: Validation complete\n    \n    UO->>+BP: export_result()\n    BP-->>-UO: Cytoscape JSON schema\n    UO-->>-FastAPI: Bronze schema generated\n    FastAPI-->>-Client: Success response with schema\n\n    Note over Client, LLM: Unified Framework - Silver Stage\n\n    Client->>+FastAPI: POST /processSchema {\"schema_type\": \"silver\"}\n    FastAPI->>+UO: orchestrate(\"silver\", config)\n    UO->>+CL: load_config(\"silver\")\n    CL->>CL: Load silver_config.py, silver_prompts.txt, field_mappings.py\n    CL-->>-UO: Return silver configuration\n    \n    UO->>+SP: initialize(silver_config)\n    SP-->>-UO: Processor ready\n    \n    UO->>+SP: process_metadata()\n    SP->>+MIS: ingest_metadata(bronze_collections)\n    MIS->>+MongoDB: Read bronze table/column metadata\n    MIS-->>-SP: Bronze metadata\n    \n    SP->>+LIS: generate_business_keys(metadata, silver_prompts)\n    LIS->>+LLM: Business key analysis with silver prompts\n    LLM-->>-LIS: Business key recommendations\n    LIS->>+ES: generate_embeddings(business_keys)\n    ES-->>-LIS: BK embeddings\n    LIS-->>-SP: Business keys with embeddings\n    \n    SP->>+MongoDB: Store business key collection\n    MongoDB-->>-SP: Confirm storage\n    SP-->>-UO: Business key generation complete\n    \n    UO->>+SP: generate_relationships()\n    SP->>+LIS: generate_data_vault_structure(business_keys, silver_prompts)\n    LIS->>+LLM: Generate Hubs & Satellites\n    LLM-->>-LIS: Hub/Satellite structures\n    LIS-->>-SP: Data Vault components\n    \n    SP->>+LIS: generate_links(hubs, silver_prompts)\n    LIS->>+LLM: Generate Links between Hubs\n    LLM-->>-LIS: Link relationships\n    LIS-->>-SP: Link mappings\n    \n    SP->>+MongoDB: Store crude data vault collection\n    MongoDB-->>-SP: Confirm storage\n    SP-->>-UO: Data Vault generation complete\n    \n    UO->>+SP: create_schema()\n    SP->>+RDS: validate_with_rag(data_vault_components)\n    RDS->>+MongoDB: Load RAG context\n    MongoDB-->>-RDS: RAG validation data\n    RDS->>+LIS: refine_data_vault(rag_context, silver_prompts)\n    LIS->>+LLM: DV 2.0 compliance validation\n    LLM-->>-LIS: Refined components\n    LIS-->>-RDS: Validated data vault\n    RDS-->>-SP: Final data vault structure\n    \n    SP->>+MongoDB: Store final data vault collection\n    MongoDB-->>-SP: Confirm storage\n    SP-->>-UO: Schema creation complete\n    \n    UO->>+SP: validate_output()\n    SP->>+VS: validate_schema(data_vault_format)\n    VS-->>-SP: Validation results\n    SP-->>-UO: Validation complete\n    \n    UO->>+SP: export_result()\n    SP-->>-UO: Data Vault DDL/Metadata\n    UO-->>-FastAPI: Silver schema generated\n    FastAPI-->>-Client: Success response with schema\n\n    Note over Client, LLM: Unified Framework - Gold Stage (Future)\n\n    Client->>+FastAPI: POST /processSchema {\"schema_type\": \"gold\"}\n    FastAPI->>+UO: orchestrate(\"gold\", config)\n    UO->>+CL: load_config(\"gold\")\n    CL-->>-UO: Return gold configuration\n    UO->>+GP: initialize(gold_config)\n    GP->>GP: Star schema generation logic\n    GP-->>-UO: Star schema result\n    UO-->>-FastAPI: Gold schema generated\n    FastAPI-->>-Client: Success response with schema\n\n    Note over Client, LLM: Direct Execution Mode\n\n    participant Main as main.py\n    Main->>+UO: orchestrate(schema_type, config)\n    UO->>UO: Load appropriate processor\n    UO->>UO: Execute 5-step pipeline\n    UO-->>-Main: Schema generation complete\n```\n","x":-1680,"y":-2680,"width":3800,"height":5800},
		{"id":"9489d0ce5074b10f","type":"text","text":"``` mermaid\n\nsequenceDiagram\n    participant User as File Arrival (Blob / Airbyte / UI)\n    participant Pre as Pre-Processor\n    participant Chunk as Chunker\n    participant RAGBase as Base RAG (Metadata + IDs)\n    participant RAGFile as File RAG (Incoming Chunks)\n    participant LLM as LLM Inference\n    participant ID as Deterministic ID Processor\n    participant Val as Validator / Human-in-Loop\n    participant Cat as Catalog / Registry\n\n    User ->> Pre: New file detected\n    Pre ->> Pre: Identify file type (DDL, SQL, PDF, Metadata, etc.)\n    Pre ->> Pre: Determine source + domain\n    Pre ->> Chunk: Decide chunking strategy (chunk type + size)\n    Chunk ->> RAGFile: Store file chunks for lookup\n    \n    Pre ->> RAGBase: Retrieve related base metadata context\n    Pre ->> RAGFile: Retrieve file chunk context\n    Pre ->> LLM: Send dual RAG context (Base + File chunks)\n\n    LLM ->> LLM: Infer structured JSON output\n    LLM ->> ID: Send inference results\n\n    ID ->> RAGBase: Check existing entities by ID\n    alt Existing entity\n        ID ->> RAGBase: Update metadata with same ID\n    else New entity\n        ID ->> RAGBase: Generate new ID & insert\n    end\n\n    ID ->> Val: Validate consistency (conflict/ambiguity check)\n    alt Validation passed\n        Val ->> Cat: Register / update catalog\n    else Conflict or ambiguity\n        Val ->> Human: Escalate for manual approval\n        Human ->> Cat: Approve & update catalog\n    end\n\n    Cat ->> [User]: File successfully processed & metadata updated\n\n```\n","x":-120,"y":-4680,"width":2920,"height":1360},
		{"id":"442cf305b42ef039","type":"text","text":"![[Pasted image 20250818175253.png]]\n","x":520,"y":-5440,"width":920,"height":660},
		{"id":"e4f3d014358a9fbc","type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    Start([Pipeline Start]) --> Bronze{Bronze Schema}\n    \n    Bronze --> BP1[Bronze P1]\n    BP1 --> BP1_Try{Try BP1}\n    BP1_Try -->|Success| BP2[Bronze P2]\n    BP1_Try -->|Error| BP1_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n    BP1_Retry -->|Yes| BP1_Try\n    BP1_Retry -->|No| BP1_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status Bronze Failed]\n    BP1_Fallback --> Alert_Bronze_Failed[Send Alert: Bronze Failed]\n    Alert_Bronze_Failed --> End([End])\n    \n    BP2 --> BP2_Try{Try BP2}\n    BP2_Try -->|Success| BP3[Bronze P3]\n    BP2_Try -->|Error| BP2_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n    BP2_Retry -->|Yes| BP2_Try\n    BP2_Retry -->|No| BP2_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status Bronze Failed]\n    BP2_Fallback --> Alert_Bronze_Failed\n    \n    BP3 --> BP3_Try{Try BP3}\n    BP3_Try -->|Success| Bronze_Complete[Update: Bronze Completed]\n    BP3_Try -->|Error| BP3_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n    BP3_Retry -->|Yes| BP3_Try\n    BP3_Retry -->|No| BP3_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status Bronze Failed]\n    BP3_Fallback --> Alert_Bronze_Failed\n    \n    Bronze_Complete --> Silver{Silver Schema}\n    \n    Silver --> SP1[Silver P1]\n    SP1 --> SP1_Try{Try SP1}\n    SP1_Try -->|Success| SP2[Silver P2]\n    SP1_Try -->|Error| SP1_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n    SP1_Retry -->|Yes| SP1_Try\n    SP1_Retry -->|No| SP1_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Failed at P1<br/>Gold: Not Processed]\n    SP1_Fallback --> Alert_Silver_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Silver P1]\n    Alert_Silver_Failed --> End\n    \n    SP2 --> SP2_Try{Try SP2}\n    SP2_Try -->|Success| SP3[Silver P3]\n    SP2_Try -->|Error| SP2_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n    SP2_Retry -->|Yes| SP2_Try\n    SP2_Retry -->|No| SP2_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Failed at P2<br/>Gold: Not Processed]\n    SP2_Fallback --> Alert_Silver_P2_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Silver P2]\n    Alert_Silver_P2_Failed --> End\n    \n    SP3 --> SP3_Try{Try SP3}\n    SP3_Try -->|Success| SP4[Silver P4]\n    SP3_Try -->|Error| SP3_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n    SP3_Retry -->|Yes| SP3_Try\n    SP3_Retry -->|No| SP3_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Failed at P3<br/>Gold: Not Processed]\n    SP3_Fallback --> Alert_Silver_P3_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Silver P3]\n    Alert_Silver_P3_Failed --> End\n    \n    SP4 --> SP4_Try{Try SP4}\n    SP4_Try -->|Success| Silver_Complete[Update: Silver Completed]\n    SP4_Try -->|Error| SP4_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n    SP4_Retry -->|Yes| SP4_Try\n    SP4_Retry -->|No| SP4_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Failed at P4<br/>Gold: Not Processed]\n    SP4_Fallback --> Alert_Silver_P4_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Silver P4]\n    Alert_Silver_P4_Failed --> End\n    \n    Silver_Complete --> Gold{Gold Schema}\n    \n    Gold --> GP1[Gold P1]\n    GP1 --> GP1_Try{Try GP1}\n    GP1_Try -->|Success| GP2[Gold P2]\n    GP1_Try -->|Error| GP1_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n    GP1_Retry -->|Yes| GP1_Try\n    GP1_Retry -->|No| GP1_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Completed<br/>Gold: Failed at P1]\n    GP1_Fallback --> Alert_Gold_P1_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Gold P1]\n    Alert_Gold_P1_Failed --> End\n    \n    GP2 --> GP2_Try{Try GP2}\n    GP2_Try -->|Success| Gold_Complete[Update: Gold Completed]\n    GP2_Try -->|Error| GP2_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n    GP2_Retry -->|Yes| GP2_Try\n    GP2_Retry -->|No| GP2_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Completed<br/>Gold: Failed at P2]\n    GP2_Fallback --> Alert_Gold_P2_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Gold P2]\n    Alert_Gold_P2_Failed --> End\n    \n    Gold_Complete --> Final_Status[Update: All Schema Types Completed]\n    Final_Status --> Alert_Success[Send Alert: Pipeline Completed Successfully]\n    Alert_Success --> End\n    \n    style Start fill:#90EE90\n    style End fill:#FFB6C1\n    style BP1_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n    style SP1_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n    style SP2_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n    style SP3_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n    style SP4_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n    style GP1_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n    style GP2_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n    style Bronze_Complete fill:#98FB98\n    style Silver_Complete fill:#98FB98\n    style Gold_Complete fill:#98FB98\n    style Final_Status fill:#98FB98\n```\n\n\n","x":-5560,"y":-4840,"width":2120,"height":5480},
		{"id":"754d4ecbd7f4abf8","type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"pipeline_id\": \"unique_pipeline_id\",\n  \"execution_timestamp\": \"2025-08-19T10:30:00Z\",\n  \"overall_status\": \"failed\",\n  \"schema_types\": {\n    \"bronze\": {\n      \"status\": \"completed\",\n      \"message\": \"All processes completed successfully\",\n      \"processes\": {\n        \"p1\": \"completed\",\n        \"p2\": \"completed\", \n        \"p3\": \"completed\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"silver\": {\n      \"status\": \"failed\",\n      \"message\": \"Failed in process p2 after 3 retry attempts\",\n      \"failed_process\": \"p2\",\n      \"processes\": {\n        \"p1\": \"completed\",\n        \"p2\": \"failed\",\n        \"p3\": \"not_processed\",\n        \"p4\": \"not_processed\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"gold\": {\n      \"status\": \"not_processed\",\n      \"message\": \"Not processed due to upstream failure\",\n      \"processes\": {\n        \"p1\": \"not_processed\",\n        \"p2\": \"not_processed\"\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"retry_details\": {\n    \"failed_at\": \"silver.p2\",\n    \"retry_count\": 3,\n    \"error_message\": \"Connection timeout after 30 seconds\"\n  }\n}\n```\n","x":-6800,"y":-6880,"width":1160,"height":1120},
		{"id":"4369482832f5ce32","type":"text","text":"# prompt\nHey I am doing the fallback mechanism where I will attach the mermaid code below\n\n```mermaid\n\nflowchart TD\n\nStart([Pipeline Start]) --> Bronze{Bronze Schema}\n\nBronze --> BP1[Bronze P1]\n\nBP1 --> BP1_Try{Try BP1}\n\nBP1_Try -->|Success| BP2[Bronze P2]\n\nBP1_Try -->|Error| BP1_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n\nBP1_Retry -->|Yes| BP1_Try\n\nBP1_Retry -->|No| BP1_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status Bronze Failed]\n\nBP1_Fallback --> Alert_Bronze_Failed[Send Alert: Bronze Failed]\n\nAlert_Bronze_Failed --> End([End])\n\nBP2 --> BP2_Try{Try BP2}\n\nBP2_Try -->|Success| BP3[Bronze P3]\n\nBP2_Try -->|Error| BP2_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n\nBP2_Retry -->|Yes| BP2_Try\n\nBP2_Retry -->|No| BP2_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status Bronze Failed]\n\nBP2_Fallback --> Alert_Bronze_Failed\n\nBP3 --> BP3_Try{Try BP3}\n\nBP3_Try -->|Success| Bronze_Complete[Update: Bronze Completed]\n\nBP3_Try -->|Error| BP3_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n\nBP3_Retry -->|Yes| BP3_Try\n\nBP3_Retry -->|No| BP3_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status Bronze Failed]\n\nBP3_Fallback --> Alert_Bronze_Failed\n\nBronze_Complete --> Silver{Silver Schema}\n\nSilver --> SP1[Silver P1]\n\nSP1 --> SP1_Try{Try SP1}\n\nSP1_Try -->|Success| SP2[Silver P2]\n\nSP1_Try -->|Error| SP1_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n\nSP1_Retry -->|Yes| SP1_Try\n\nSP1_Retry -->|No| SP1_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Failed at P1<br/>Gold: Not Processed]\n\nSP1_Fallback --> Alert_Silver_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Silver P1]\n\nAlert_Silver_Failed --> End\n\nSP2 --> SP2_Try{Try SP2}\n\nSP2_Try -->|Success| SP3[Silver P3]\n\nSP2_Try -->|Error| SP2_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n\nSP2_Retry -->|Yes| SP2_Try\n\nSP2_Retry -->|No| SP2_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Failed at P2<br/>Gold: Not Processed]\n\nSP2_Fallback --> Alert_Silver_P2_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Silver P2]\n\nAlert_Silver_P2_Failed --> End\n\nSP3 --> SP3_Try{Try SP3}\n\nSP3_Try -->|Success| SP4[Silver P4]\n\nSP3_Try -->|Error| SP3_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n\nSP3_Retry -->|Yes| SP3_Try\n\nSP3_Retry -->|No| SP3_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Failed at P3<br/>Gold: Not Processed]\n\nSP3_Fallback --> Alert_Silver_P3_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Silver P3]\n\nAlert_Silver_P3_Failed --> End\n\nSP4 --> SP4_Try{Try SP4}\n\nSP4_Try -->|Success| Silver_Complete[Update: Silver Completed]\n\nSP4_Try -->|Error| SP4_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n\nSP4_Retry -->|Yes| SP4_Try\n\nSP4_Retry -->|No| SP4_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Failed at P4<br/>Gold: Not Processed]\n\nSP4_Fallback --> Alert_Silver_P4_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Silver P4]\n\nAlert_Silver_P4_Failed --> End\n\nSilver_Complete --> Gold{Gold Schema}\n\nGold --> GP1[Gold P1]\n\nGP1 --> GP1_Try{Try GP1}\n\nGP1_Try -->|Success| GP2[Gold P2]\n\nGP1_Try -->|Error| GP1_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n\nGP1_Retry -->|Yes| GP1_Try\n\nGP1_Retry -->|No| GP1_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Completed<br/>Gold: Failed at P1]\n\nGP1_Fallback --> Alert_Gold_P1_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Gold P1]\n\nAlert_Gold_P1_Failed --> End\n\nGP2 --> GP2_Try{Try GP2}\n\nGP2_Try -->|Success| Gold_Complete[Update: Gold Completed]\n\nGP2_Try -->|Error| GP2_Retry{Retry Count < 3?}\n\nGP2_Retry -->|Yes| GP2_Try\n\nGP2_Retry -->|No| GP2_Fallback[Fallback: Update Status<br/>Bronze: Completed<br/>Silver: Completed<br/>Gold: Failed at P2]\n\nGP2_Fallback --> Alert_Gold_P2_Failed[Send Alert: Pipeline Failed at Gold P2]\n\nAlert_Gold_P2_Failed --> End\n\nGold_Complete --> Final_Status[Update: All Schema Types Completed]\n\nFinal_Status --> Alert_Success[Send Alert: Pipeline Completed Successfully]\n\nAlert_Success --> End\n\nstyle Start fill:#90EE90\n\nstyle End fill:#FFB6C1\n\nstyle BP1_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n\nstyle SP1_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n\nstyle SP2_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n\nstyle SP3_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n\nstyle SP4_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n\nstyle GP1_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n\nstyle GP2_Fallback fill:#FFA07A\n\nstyle Bronze_Complete fill:#98FB98\n\nstyle Silver_Complete fill:#98FB98\n\nstyle Gold_Complete fill:#98FB98\n\nstyle Final_Status fill:#98FB98\n\n```\n\nThis is my flow now i need you to give me the skeleton code. I am implementing this only for try except blocks in my project functions.\n\nFirst we will design the skeleton and then we can start implementing the rest.","x":-4000,"y":-7734,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"4e48fb1ca7e5a2cb","x":-2720,"y":-12560,"width":4480,"height":3680,"type":"text","text":"```mermaid\nsequenceDiagram\n\nparticipant User as 👤 User\n\nparticipant Entry as 📋 run_bronze_metadata_validation\n\nparticipant Orchestrator as 🎯 ValidationOrchestrator\n\nparticipant Config as 🔧 ConfigLoader\n\nparticipant Validator as 🤖 BronzeMetadataValidator\n\nparticipant MongoDB as 🗄️ MongoDB\n\nparticipant LLM as 🤖 Azure OpenAI\n\nparticipant PromptLoader as 📂 PromptLoader\n\nparticipant Parser as 📊 JSONParser\n\n  \n\nNote over User, Parser: Validation Framework Execution Flow\n\n  \n\n%% Initialization Phase\n\nUser->>+Entry: await run_bronze_metadata_validation()\n\nEntry->>+Orchestrator: ValidationOrchestrator()\n\nOrchestrator->>Orchestrator: _register_validators()\n\nNote right of Orchestrator: Registers BronzeMetadataValidator\n\n  \n\n%% Configuration Loading\n\nOrchestrator->>+Config: load_config(\"bronze\")\n\nConfig-->>-Orchestrator: config object\n\n  \n\n%% Validator Creation\n\nOrchestrator->>+Validator: BronzeMetadataValidator(config)\n\n  \n\n%% MongoDB Initialization\n\nValidator->>+MongoDB: MongoClient(connection_string)\n\nMongoDB-->>-Validator: client connection\n\nValidator->>MongoDB: get collections (tables, columns)\n\nMongoDB-->>Validator: collection references\n\n  \n\n%% LLM Initialization\n\nValidator->>+LLM: AzureChatOpenAI(config)\n\nLLM-->>-Validator: llm client\n\n  \n\nValidator-->>-Orchestrator: validator instance\n\n  \n\n%% Start Validation Pipeline\n\nOrchestrator->>+Validator: run_validation()\n\n  \n\n%% Step 1: Load Input Data\n\nNote over Validator, MongoDB: Step 1: Load Input Data\n\nValidator->>+MongoDB: count_documents(tables)\n\nMongoDB-->>-Validator: total_tables: 25\n\n  \n\nValidator->>+MongoDB: count_documents(tables_with_desc)\n\nMongoDB-->>-Validator: tables_with_desc: 15\n\n  \n\nValidator->>+MongoDB: find(tables_with_desc, limit=10)\n\nMongoDB-->>-Validator: 10 tables\n\n  \n\nloop For each table (10 iterations)\n\nValidator->>+MongoDB: find(columns for table_id)\n\nMongoDB-->>-Validator: columns list\n\nend\n\n  \n\nNote right of Validator: validation_data prepared\\n10 tables, 157 columns\n\n  \n\n%% Step 2: Validation Process\n\nNote over Validator, Parser: Step 2: Validation Process\n\n  \n\nloop For each table (10 iterations)\n\n%% Table Description Validation\n\nValidator->>+PromptLoader: load_prompt(\"validation_prompts/...\")\n\nPromptLoader-->>-Validator: system_prompt\n\n  \n\nValidator->>Validator: create user_prompt\n\n  \n\nValidator->>+LLM: _query_llm(system_prompt, user_prompt)\n\nNote right of LLM: LLM Call #1-10\\nTable Validation\n\nLLM-->>-Validator: llm_response (JSON string)\n\n  \n\nValidator->>+Parser: parse_llm_response(llm_response)\n\nParser-->>-Validator: validation_result\n\n  \n\nNote right of Validator: Table validation result\\n- clarity_score: 1-5\\n- completeness_score: 1-5\\n- accuracy_score: 1-5\\n- business_value_score: 1-5\\n- overall_score: 3.00 avg\n\n  \n\n%% Column Description Validation Loop\n\nloop For each column in table (157 total)\n\nValidator->>+PromptLoader: load_prompt(\"validation_prompts/...\")\n\nPromptLoader-->>-Validator: system_prompt\n\n  \n\nValidator->>Validator: create user_prompt\n\n  \n\nValidator->>+LLM: _query_llm(system_prompt, user_prompt)\n\nNote right of LLM: LLM Call #11-167\\nColumn Validation\n\nLLM-->>-Validator: llm_response (JSON string)\n\n  \n\nValidator->>+Parser: parse_llm_response(llm_response)\n\nParser-->>-Validator: validation_result\n\n  \n\nNote right of Validator: Column validation result\\n- clarity_score: 1-5\\n- completeness_score: 1-5\\n- accuracy_score: 1-5\\n- business_value_score: 1-5\\n- overall_score: 3.57 avg\n\nend\n\nend\n\n  \n\n%% Step 3: Generate Report\n\nNote over Validator: Step 3: Generate Report\n\nValidator->>Validator: _calculate_summary_metrics()\n\nNote right of Validator: Summary metrics calculated\\n- avg_table_score: 3.00\\n- avg_column_score: 3.57\\n- total_issues: 333\\n- tables_with_issues: count\\n- columns_with_issues: count\n\n  \n\nValidator->>Validator: _generate_recommendations()\n\nNote right of Validator: Recommendations generated\\n- Improvement suggestions\\n- Action items\\n- Quality thresholds\n\n  \n\nValidator->>Validator: generate_report()\n\nNote right of Validator: Final validation report\\n- validation_id: val_20250818_123112\\n- validator_type: bronze_metadata_validator\\n- status: completed\\n- summary + detailed_results\\n- recommendations\n\n  \n\nValidator-->>-Orchestrator: validation_report\n\nOrchestrator-->>-Entry: validation_report\n\nEntry-->>-User: validation_report\n\n  \n\n%% Success Summary\n\nNote over User: 🎉 Validation Complete!\\n✅ 10 Tables Validated\\n✅ 157 Columns Validated\\n📊 Quality Scores Generated\\n🔍 333 Issues Identified\n\n  \n\n%% Error Handling (Alternative Flow)\n\nNote over Validator, Parser: Error Handling (if exceptions occur)\n\nalt Exception during validation\n\nValidator->>Validator: _create_error_report(error_message)\n\nValidator-->>Orchestrator: error_report\n\nNote right of Validator: Error report includes\\n- validation_id\\n- error_message\\n- timestamp\\n- status: \"error\"\n\nend\n\n  \n\n%% Future Enhancements (Dotted lines for potential future features)\n\nNote over User, Parser: 🔮 Future Enhancements (Not Implemented)\n\nValidator-.->MongoDB: Store validation reports\n\nValidator-.->User: Quality alerts & notifications\n\nValidator-.->User: Validation dashboard\n```\n"},
		{"id":"4d19c6e7d14aa231","x":-2720,"y":-12620,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Validation Process"}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"7e2b2dc3e5840c10","fromNode":"754d4ecbd7f4abf8","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"e4f3d014358a9fbc","toSide":"top"}
	]
}